sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant A as Alice (browser)
  participant S as API + Socket.IO
  participant M as MongoDB
  participant B as Bob (browser, any page)
  A->>S: connect (auth.token = JWT)
  S->>M: load user, reject if inactive or stale token
  S-->>A: connected, joined user room
  B->>S: connect (JWT)
  A->>S: chat:send {to: Bob, text}
  S->>S: check canMessage(classmate or instructor), sanitise, rate-limit
  S->>M: insert Message
  S-->>A: chat:message (sender copy)
  S-->>B: chat:message (if Bob has the chat open)
  S->>M: upsert unread "message" Notification (coalesced per sender)
  S-->>B: notification:new
  B->>B: toast + bell count, no page refresh
